stdout:
stderr:
Usage of baseline:
  -concurrency int
    	concurrent synthetic request workers for baseline soak testing (default 1)
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -last string
    	bounded evidence lookback (default "30m")
  -local
    	capture local HTTP benchmark baseline without Prometheus, Tempo, or Loki (requires --url)
  -loki string
    	Loki base URL for log evidence (default "http://localhost:3100")
  -method string
    	HTTP method for baseline soak requests (default "GET")
  -prometheus string
    	Prometheus base URL (default "http://localhost:9090")
  -rate float
    	rate limit in requests per second for baseline soak testing; 0 means unlimited. Unset defaults to 50 with --soak, unlimited otherwise (default -1)
  -service string
    	target service.name for scoped evidence
  -soak duration
    	sustained soak duration to capture load profile (requires --url)
  -tempo string
    	Tempo base URL for trace evidence (default "http://localhost:3200")
  -timeout duration
    	per-request HTTP timeout for baseline soak requests (default 5s)
  -url string
    	target application URL for baseline soak testing
